# Copy to apps/worker/.dev.vars (gitignored) for local `wrangler dev`.
# These are LOCAL development values only — never real production secrets.
#
# Authentication needs NOTHING here: password hashing (PBKDF2) and session-token
# hashing (SHA-256) use the Workers runtime's Web Crypto. See
# docs/architecture/auth.md.

# Comma-separated extra browser origins allowed to send credentialed requests.
# The localhost dev origins (3000 / 8081 / 19006) are always allowed.
# CORS_ORIGINS=

# Observability (optional)
SENTRY_DSN=
POSTHOG_KEY=
POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com
